e=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Community</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a href=\"https://sleeping-robot-games.itch.io/mini-me-mao/devlog\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4681219/mini-me-mao\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Mini Me-Mao\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMTc5MTUyLnBuZw==/original/iofcpP.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Mini Me-Mao</h1></div><div class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top ready\" id=\"view_html_game_30612\"><div class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\" id=\"html_embed_4082231\"><div data-height=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px; height: 540px\" data-width=\"540\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\"><button title=\"Enter fullscreen\" class=\"fullscreen_btn\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1790703660\"/></button><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/18803604-2036610/index.html?v=1790699413&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"24\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a href=\"https://sleeping-robot-games.itch.io/mini-me-mao/purchase\" data-donate=\"false\" class=\"button donate_btn\">Download Now</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><blockquote class=\"text-justify\">Web demo is to preview the game functionality before downloading.&nbsp;The game is designed to be a desktop companion running on your screen. Tab must remain open to progress in web demo!<strong><br></strong></blockquote>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4979870/Mini_MeMao/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NzA0NzkzLmdpZg==/original/Yi%2FCK7.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br></p>\r\n<p><br>A mini <strong>companion that lives right on your desktop!</strong> Unpack and decorate a cozy digital dollhouse, dress up your mini and watch them paint while you work or play. Sell their art for gold, unlock new painting styles, collect charming decorations, and create the perfect space that grows with you.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MzgyMzcyLmdpZg==/original/SueUzh.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><span></span></p>\r\n<h3>Mini Me-Mao&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p>Mini Me-Mao is a cozy <strong>desktop companion</strong> that lives right on your screen. Drag your digital dollhouse anywhere you&#x27;d like and then let your mini paint while you work, study, or play.&nbsp;Minimize the game into a sleek, docked version for a more convenient, non-intrusive way to keep playing.</p>\r\n<h4>An artist who works alongside you</h4>\r\n<p> Your mini paints on their own in the background. Check in and see the pieces of art that they&#x27;ve created, then sell them to the gallery for in-game gold.\r\n</p>\r\n<h4>Decorate your Dollhouse</h4>\r\n<p> Cozy up your room with charming decorations. With over 150+ items to decorate your room with there’s always something new to add or change up. We’re constantly adding more decorations to the game as time goes on!<br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MjcyMjE5LnBuZw==/original/yyY7tv.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h4>Dress up your mini </h4>\r\n<p>Give your mini a look of their own through hairstyles, clothing, and accessories. Unlock new styles as they become available in the apparel shop. Over 135 trillion possible character combinations so no two minis look alike!<br><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MjcyNzg1LmdpZg==/original/R3tSs6.gif\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n</p>\r\n<h4>Unlock Painting Styles</h4>\r\n<p> Level up your mini&#x27;s painting skills to unlock new ways for them to paint, from simple Doodles to intricate Master works, each one improving in quality as your mini gets better. Collect all star ratings for a painting to master it and unlock it as special decoration to display in your room. Master each painting in the collection!</p>\r\n<h4>Level Up</h4>\r\n<p>Give your mini ways to level up their skills such as fitness equipment or books to read.</p>\r\n<ul><li>Painting - Unlock different artistic styles that are increasingly worth more</li><li>Fitness - Build your stamina to create for longer</li><li>Logic - Improve your draftsmanship to sell paintings at a higher standard</li></ul>\r\n<h4>Features</h4>\r\n<ul><li>A  desktop companion you can place anywhere and have run in the background\r\n</li><li>Minimize the game to a non-intrusive docked version<br>\r\n</li><li>Sell finished paintings for gold in the gallery\r\n</li><li>Shop daily deals and decorate with furniture, wallpaper, flooring, and knick-knacks in your room\r\n</li><li>Daily Deals reset twice a day</li><li>Dress up your mini with a wide array of outfits\r\n</li><li>Shop for new clothing or hairstyles</li><li>Idle painting: your mini creates art while you work or play on other tasks\r\n</li><li>Unlockable painting styles, each improving in quality as your mini&#x27;s skill grows\r\n</li><li>Resize the game to fit your screen how you like&nbsp;</li><li>No popups, no timers, no pressure: every menu is player-driven</li></ul>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h4>Roadmap</h4>\r\n<ul><li><del>Style Shop</del> &lt;done!&gt;</li><li><del>Wardrobe&nbsp;</del>&nbsp;&lt;done!&gt;<br>\r\n</li><li>Equip outfits for any occasion!</li><li>Creativity and Charisma skills\r\n</li><li>Pets\r\n</li><li>Multiple Rooms\r\n</li><li><del>Minimize Game Window&nbsp;</del> &lt;done!&gt;</li><li>Roommates\r\n</li><li>Create your own pixel art masterpieces</li><li>Multiplayer snail mail system</li></ul>\r\n<h4>FAQ</h4>\r\n<p><strong>Q.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Is this a web based game?<br></strong><strong>A.&nbsp;</strong>The game is designed be to played on the Desktop as a companion, though we offer an HTML demo to preview the gameplay before downloading.<br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Q. Are you on Steam?<br></strong><strong>A.&nbsp;</strong>The game will be on Steam and the page will be announced soon once it&#x27;s published, please check back so you can wishlist there!<br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Q. I&nbsp;found a bug or want to request a feature. How do I contact you?<br></strong><strong>A.&nbsp;</strong>You can leave a comment on Itch.io in the Community Discussion Board or message us in our <a href=\"https://discord.gg/zAxUhJ4F2H\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Discord</a> server. We also would love to see the rooms and characters you create!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Q. I love your capsule art! Who is the artist?</strong><br>A. The capsule art was created by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dinghuart/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Ding Hu Art (Instagram)</a>!&nbsp;<br></p>\r\n<h4>Contribute</h4>\r\n<p>This game is still in it&#x27;s early stages and we would love to get as much feedback as possible to improve the experience and make the game you want to play! Leave comments here or&nbsp;use the in-game feedback button.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Interested in supporting us even further? Check out our Kofi page here: <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/sleepingrobotgames\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://ko-fi.com/sleepingrobotgames</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MjcyNDEwLnBuZw==/original/aJe5xy.png\" loading=\"lazy\"> <br>You can also join our Discord community here:<br> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zAxUhJ4F2H\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://discord.gg/zAxUhJ4F2H</a><br></p>\r\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://sleeping-robot-games.itch.io/mini-me-mao/rate\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxMjk0MTc2LmdpZg==/original/Ja%2F10F.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;\r\n<strong>If you enjoy the game, please rate us!</strong>\r\n</p>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwNDYxNDI2LmdpZg==/original/5JnAjS.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<p>Love the character sprites in Mini Me-Mao? You can generate you&#x27;re own using our Sprite Creator tool!<br></p>\r\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://itch.io/embed/3293709?bg_color=decdcb&fg_color=222222&link_color=fa5c5c&border_color=c98762\" width=\"552\" height=\"167\">&lt;a href=&quot;<a href=\"https://sleeping-robot-games.itch.io/sprite-sheet-creator\">Memao&quot; class=&quot;redactor-linkify-object&quot;&gt;https://sleeping-robot-games.itch.io/sprite-sheet-creator&quot;&gt;Memao</a> Sprite Sheet Creator by Sleeping Robot Games, Memao, TheSleepingRobot&lt;/a&gt;</iframe><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" height=\"6\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_4257352\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"29 September 2026 @ 16:21 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 2 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HT